<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="ceaf5388c2454975b907b35ddca9ea4b">分层场景：补偿执行</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="e333c5fb23814e5e8e6725fef1c1ec11" />
<h1 nodeId="953d854fd53c451198f5dcb10c1b5ff5">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="6b89c3f1ee5a4b7bb14d770dc0b2976d"><span font-size="15">策略分层执行的方式是将</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">更重要能快速判断出结果</span></span><span font-size="15">的策略</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">优先执行</span></span><span font-size="15">（类似黑白名单/基础参数判断等），</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">复杂且高耗时</span></span><span font-size="15">的规则</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">后执行或不执行</span></span><span font-size="15">，因此在实时链路中就会存在一些未执行的策略，异步补偿就是将这部分本应执行完成，但因为分层未执行的部分在异步链路重新执行。</span></p>
<h1 nodeId="06b2406f71d24f0cad9243b21f760698">二、目的</h1>
<ul nodeId="c4086beaf3ee4dd29b06540f4bb01efc">
<li nodeId="2c67d692f60e441d8f866cefa9ba485e"><span font-size="15">风险补偿：在实时链路本应该执行完成，但因 超时 而未执行的部分，使全流量逻辑执行完成100%</span></li>
<li nodeId="60cf40afdd7c4dd1a5ecd8ed0af541aa">
<p align="start" nodeId="9ff02c508f4543c68fb1d422f0bd8015"><span font-size="15">养数据&amp;特征：在全流量逻辑执行完成100%后，相较于策略并行执行但策略分层根本就没有执行到的策略，重新执行，用于模型、名单等做基础特征数据的数据源。</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="a984250c9bf644279bedd0f167659b20">三、逻辑介绍</h1>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1610062169/31427112010?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="1016" height="435" nodeId="bfd7031a1d704ea6afb139432b75358e" />
<h2 align="start" nodeId="831ddec4ff384fc3a457b131231242cb">3.1 流程说明</h2>
<p nodeId="d6fedd9b6b3a437cbacd56d4d53e51da"><span font-size="15">以不同颜色的线来介绍分层场景中的几类情况。（一句话：目前只有蓝色链路会补偿）</span></p>
<ul nodeId="ee1b52578fa54b2fa8ee2e1ef21fa0fb">
<li nodeId="5f95833c1ccb445f86ee7dc2a15a6b82"><span font-size="15">红色：在</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">实时</span></span><span font-size="15">链路中</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">正常执行</span></span><span font-size="15">的部分；</span></li>
<li nodeId="8bb25735275b47efb0e9c2639d600abc"><span font-size="15">黑色：</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">路由条件</span></span><span font-size="15">不满足的分支，在实时和异步补偿链路中</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">都不会</span></span><span font-size="15">执行。</span></li>
<li nodeId="a4d86bacacc4430095abac9743619c78"><span font-size="15">绿色：</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">满足短路条件</span></span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="15">而发生短路的分支</span></span><span font-size="15">，默认在实时链路中</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">不会</span></span><span font-size="15">执行。（用户可自定义该场景 需要对短路情况也进行补偿执行，见3.3）</span></li>
<li nodeId="6b2d33af3228422da46e35992e1f4255"><span font-size="15">蓝色：执行</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">超时</span></span><span font-size="15">，未执行到</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">本应执行</span></span><span font-size="15">的部分。将在补偿链路（worker）中执行，补偿自动触发。</span></li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="164fbf59a3e84142863a31aababd23cb"><span font-size="15">补偿链路中，规则状态为标记/生效，都将在worker中执行；状态为离线的不执行。</span></p>
<h2 nodeId="0fd013f4f9fe401ca995b87b351148b3">3.2 补偿的决策执行</h2>
<p align="start" nodeId="d333e990c820448c80dfb1809adc82c0"><span font-size="15">补偿链路中，普通决策（拦截、通过、验证等）直接落库，无法返回给调用方；</span></p>
<p nodeId="1a58cf6f66684f6e986274153361a45d"><span font-size="15">而异步决策（如写名单、写kv）还是会输出给Tatooine异步执行。</span></p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="df2389f55504493883a1c02cfc27bff9">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="97aa04a813024aefb703ba61fb65285d">普通决策、异步决策概念见：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="d63ffcaa9c744affb1440eb75c5e244e">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813</a></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="5c9c98af239c496d805c554fe37cae68">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="2fe9363cb0b041f3bde69dc696a89c47">通过补偿决策的设置，可以让补偿链路中命中的「普通决策」转化为「异步决策」再下发执行。配置方式见：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1409924045#id-3.4%20%E8%A1%A5%E5%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1409924045#id-3.4%20%E8%A1%A5%E5%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="7f26c6778fa043e887cf18b13aecc659">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1409924045#id-3.4%20%E8%A1%A5%E5%81%BF%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96</a></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="df10480f9900433b83c531985c31ca5b"><span color=""><span font-size="15">补偿数据落库机制：补偿日志与实时日志入库链路和存储 与当前保持一致。</span></span></p>
<h2 nodeId="ebbff1a0317b4c1b81961e00f691482f">3.3 开启短路补偿</h2>
